<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Features · Kurukoo</title><meta name="description" content="See what Kurukoo can help you understand, discover, organize, coordinate and get done."><link rel="icon" href="/assets/brand/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css?v=1.2.1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/kurukoo-public-pages.css?v=3"></head><body><main class="k-public-page"><header class="k-public-page-header"><a href="/" class="k-public-brand">Kurukoo</a><nav><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/chat">Ask Kurukoo</a></nav></header><section class="k-public-hero"><span class="k-eyebrow">Features</span><h1>One conversational system for figuring things out and getting things done.</h1><p>Kurukoo combines Agent, discovery, requests, tasks, memory, connections, economic coordination and network participation around one conversation-first relationship.</p><a class="k-button-primary" href="/chat">Ask Kurukoo</a></section><section class="k-public-section"><h2>Understand and organize</h2><div class="k-public-grid"><article><h3>Agent</h3><p>Talk naturally about what you need. Agent interprets context, keeps continuity and knows when a request needs clarification.</p><a href="/chat">Open Agent</a></article><article><h3>Desk</h3><p>Your authenticated home for active work, attention, recent activity and continuity across Kurukoo.</p><a href="/desk">Open Desk</a></article><article><h3>Memory</h3><p>Review and control the useful context you choose to keep connected to Kurukoo.</p><a href="/memory">Learn about Memory</a></article><article><h3>Tasks & reminders</h3><p>Turn conversations into follow-through with clear ownership, timing and recovery.</p><a href="/tasks">Explore tasks</a></article></div></section><section class="k-public-section"><h2>Discover and coordinate</h2><div class="k-public-grid"><article><h3>Discover</h3><p>Find relevant people, places, services, products, topics and opportunities.</p><a href="/discover">Explore Discover</a></article><article><h3>Requests</h3><p>Move from conversation to a governed request with explicit lifecycle and evidence.</p><a href="/requests">Requests</a></article><article><h3>Network</h3><p>Connect to people, providers, contributors, channels and capabilities without creating parallel identity.</p><a href="/network">Explore the network</a></article><article><h3>Connect</h3><p>Bring user-owned channels, devices and services into the same Kurukoo relationship.</p><a href="/connect">Connect</a></article></div></section><section class="k-public-section"><h2>Act with clear boundaries</h2><div class="k-public-grid"><article><h3>Economic coordination</h3><p>Checkout, payment, wallet, points and subscriptions are separate states; Kurukoo never implies success without evidence.</p></article><article><h3>Agents</h3><p>Bounded autonomous workers can pursue persistent goals while policy, authorization and evidence remain canonical.</p><a href="/agents">Explore Agents</a></article><article><h3>Safety</h3><p>Safety context and trusted contacts are explicit, consent-bound and never presented as emergency-service fulfilment.</p><a href="/safety">Safety</a></article></div></section></main></body></html>
